# .pii-allowlist
#
# Per-repo exemptions for the global pre-commit PII scanner
# (.config/git/hooks/pre-commit). One case-insensitive grep -E pattern per
# line; any denylist hit line or MAC/UUID-shaped token matching a pattern is
# exempt. This file is TRACKED — only list values that are already public.
# Name-shaped deanonymisers never belong here (the allowlist would itself
# be the leak); use a placeholder or PII_HOOK_BYPASS=1 instead.
#
# mobileconfig PayloadUUID / profile UUIDs (profiles/*.mobileconfig,
# profiles/mobileconfig-UUIDs.txt) — self-generated identifiers, already
# published in this repo's history. Re-staging a profile edit would
# otherwise trip the UUID token detector.
